WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.688
Ordering food by yourself. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:12.432
Read the menu online first if we like. Decide before we arrive.

3
00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:18.072
Order exactly as written: the number and the name of the dish.

4
00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:24.072
Asking for changes is normal: no onions, sauce on the side.

5
00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:29.736
If it is a counter place, we pay right away and take a number.

6
00:00:29.736 --> 00:00:35.856
If it is a table place, we pay after eating, or we go up to pay.

7
00:00:35.856 --> 00:00:43.512
If the food is wrong, saying: excuse me, this is not what I ordered, works.

8
00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:48.168
Each time we do it, it costs less energy.

9
00:00:48.168 --> 00:00:56.376
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

